  "description": "Upgrade your Ram truck with a tonneau cover designed to deliver both style and performance. This low-profile hard tri-fold cover pairs rugged protection with a sleek, aerodynamic look that sits nearly flush with your bed rails.\nWhether you're hauling tools to a jobsite, camping gear for a weekend trip, or daily essentials around town, this cover keeps your cargo safe, dry, and out of sight. The one-hand quick-release system gives you instant access, while the upgraded drainage channels and sealed edges help maintain a dry bed in all weather conditions. Lightweight yet tough, it folds easily when you need full bed space and locks\ndown securely when you don't.\nFeatures\nLow-Profile Design with Everyday Utility: Flush-mounted for a tight, factory-style fit, this tonneau cover delivers a clean, streamlined look while securely protecting your cargo.\nEnhanced Sealing & Easy Installation: Upgraded drainage channels help keep water out, while the included front seal strip and clamp-on mounting system ensure a secure fit and smooth, hassle-free installation.\nOne-Hand Quick Release Access: Open your truck bed in seconds with a convenient quick-latch system—no need to walk around the truck. One-handed operation makes loading and unloading faster and easier.\nReliable All-Weather Protection: Built to handle rain, dust, and road debris, this tonneau cover features integrated drain tubes that direct water away, keeping your truck bed dry and your gear protected year-round.\n1-year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Ram 1500 New Body with 6.4ft truck bed\nWithout Rambox or split tailgate",
